WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.840
Where I am?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.690
The nurse's office at the academy.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.670
I see.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.740
What happened?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.980
Ireena... was kidnapped.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:18.990
By whom?

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.010
The Frenzied King of Dragons, Elzard.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.480
<b>The Greatest Demon Lord 
Is Reborn as a Typical Nobody</b>

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.220
The Frenzied King of Dragons, Elzard?!

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.130
The one who nearly destroyed the 
world several thousand years ago?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.180
That monster on par with 
demons and Evil Gods?!

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.910
What does a monster like 
that want with Miss Ireena?!

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:09.950
That's probably...

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:12.060
That doesn't matter right now.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.280
We'll rescue Miss Ireena.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.680
No matter who we must face,

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.740
that's all we should be thinking about.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.320
B-But even with your strength, that's...

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:26.080
"Impossible" doesn't exist in my dictionary.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:30.040
Now that's my boy!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.540
Right, Weiss?!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.600
I have a proposal, then.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:41.720
What's this?

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.900
The royal treasury.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.430
Just use it without asking 
any questions for now.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.360
I'm entrusting everything to you.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.240
Thank you very much.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:53.400
Are you sure?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.760
We have no choice but to rely on him.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.240
That's not what I mean.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.250
You're not going to tell him about you two?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.400
Until Ireena met Ardy,

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.790
she spent all of her time 
locked up in the mansion.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:11.260
To her, every outsider was a source of fear.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:17.870
She instinctively understood that we 
couldn't keep our secret concealed forever.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.890
That's true even now.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:24.640
Yet Ireena changed after meeting Ardy.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:30.050
Though even that was because he 
didn't know the truth about us.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.620
I can't bring myself to tell Ardy the truth.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:40.070
How could I rob Ireena of the one friend 
she's finally found for herself?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.000
Will you truly be my friend?

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.020
No matter what happens?

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:55.190
You won't ever betray me or come to hate me?

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.220
I swear it on the name of 
the Demon Lord Varvatos.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.550
On the name of Varvatos...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.920
I hope we can be good friends 
from now on, Miss Ireena.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.720
By the way, I have a quick question for you.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:10.850
What's that?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.810
Could you please tell me 
the truth about yourself?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.150
I'm actually...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.060
Ard?!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.920
Ard?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:40.250
Ard!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:43.690
A dream?

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.920
What's this?!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.970
Hey there, Ireeny.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.920
How are you feeling?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:02.030
I'd like to get the ritual 
started right away.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.070
What on earth is this?!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.490
Why am I...

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:09.080
Come on, you understand, don't you?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.700
I want the blood running in your family.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.920
How do you know about us?

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:20.690
Well, how do I know, indeed?

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:21.880
More importantly, look.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.890
You can see it, can't you?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:30.160
That's called an Orphan of Chaos.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.600
It was created using the flesh from

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:37.060
one of the many Evil Gods that the 
Demon Lord Varvatos slew long ago.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:43.930
By sacrificing your blood to this 
monster with the flesh of an Evil God,

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:48.740
I can summon one of the Evil Gods from 
the dimension in which they're sealed.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.950
For what purpose?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.210
Now that's simple!

00:05:55.210 --> 00:06:01.530
Because I want to destroy this world that's 
gone soft with love, bonding, and friendship crap!

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.920
This disgusting world can go perish!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:14.600
That's all that's driven my actions since I went 
on my rampage several thousand years ago!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.930
We won't let you do that.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.990
Ard will...

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.770
Ard will come for me!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.940
Will he?

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.940
Sure, he possesses inhuman strength,

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.160
but when all is said and done, 
he's still human, you know.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.210
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.120
What if...

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.360
he were to learn about your secret?

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:39.830
What would happen then?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.150
If he were to learn the truth,

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.350
he would come to hate you.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:48.520
He would despise you as a monster.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.690
My condolences.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.440
Now, let's start the ritual.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:21.970
Ardy!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.960
You're going to rescue Miss Ireena, right?

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.110
Yes.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:32.850
Though this will entail 
quite a bit of danger,

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.680
so I can't allow you to accompany me.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.270
Ardy.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:40.170
Ardy, you gave me strength,

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.880
and I gained confidence.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.620
I thought I had changed.

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:47.650
But I couldn't make friends.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:49.360
Miss Ginny.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.990
I thought that part would never change,

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.560
and I resigned myself to being alone.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.360
But...

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.290
Miss Ireena...

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:07.500
Don't you dare hurt my friend!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.600
Ireena called me her friend.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.580
So...!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.430
Hmm.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.640
I should be able to make 
it back by dinner time.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.650
Miss Ginny.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.350
Please prepare a delicious 
dinner and wait for us.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:28.320
I'm sure Miss Ireena will 
be hungry when we return.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:33.010
Now, I'm heading off.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.230
Oh, right, right.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:40.440
You just mentioned not 
being able to make friends,

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:42.080
but Miss Ireena's not the only one.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.800
I consider you a friend, as well.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.960
Ardy!

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:52.920
Once Miss Ireena's back, let's laugh 
and do silly things together again.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.880
Yes!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:06.960
No!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.730
No! Stay away!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.300
Stay away!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.620
You monsters make a perfect pair!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.610
Ard!

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:01.520
So you came, Ard Meteor!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.160
Good day, you worms.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:13.140
You've certainly done it this time.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:16.090
I have no intention of letting 
a single one of you escape,

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.050
so prepare yourselves.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.010
Don't panic!

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:27.230
A-A Nine Cast?!

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:41.660
Miss Ireena, I'm sorry I was late.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.660
Ard!

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:51.520
I was so scared!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.090
Not bad.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:05.560
Yeah, it's been a long time 
since I've felt this way.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.130
I could go mad.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.890
Please don't worry.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:23.950
I assure you a lizard like 
this is no match for me.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.450
Look at you, showing off.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.410
You like that monster that much?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.940
Monster?

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:36.390
That woman isn't as pure as you think she is.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:39.000
She may be going by Olhyde now,

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.840
but that's just a fake name.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.980
Stop!

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.050
Don't say it!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.390
Her true name is Laville.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.510
The true royalty.

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:51.390
And that girl...

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.280
carries the blood of the Evil Gods.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:05.670
With this world's religion 
centered around the Demon Lord,

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:09.200
all of the "Evil Gods" have 
become subjects of hatred.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:11.560
If the world were to learn 
that our royal family

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.600
is descended from those Evil Gods,

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.920
it could overthrow the entire nation.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:20.770
So that's why you rule 
indirectly through proxies.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:22.930
Yes.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:25.110
Though because of that,

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:29.390
my daughter and I have also been 
forced to hide our true identities.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:34.850
Yeah, Ard doesn't know that you two 
are this country's true royalty.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.560
Because of that, my daughter...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:42.470
might lose the first friend she's ever had.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.920
Just so you know, that's the truth!

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.080
That's why Lars al Ghoul went after her!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.080
None of that even matters.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:56.750
What was that?

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:02.260
It doesn't matter if she's descended from 
Evil Gods, or even an Evil God herself.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.600
What does matter

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:07.550
is that she is kinder and more 
courageous than anyone else!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.350
She is worthy of love and respect!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:13.270
To a man like me, she's truly radiant.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.120
She's like the sun.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.000
Yet you call her monster.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.780
You dismiss her with such 
a discriminatory remark.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.490
I will never forgive you for that.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:29.450
Now I want to see your face 
twisted with despair even more.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.640
That's odd.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:41.520
It didn't look like you 
activated any defensive magic.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.320
Which means...

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.340
That spear...

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:48.300
This spear has the ability to 
nullify lightning attack spells.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:53.480
Did you think that would be 
enough to make me despair?

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:57.880
Miss Elzard,

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.600
you're not watching your feet.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:14.290
The way you fight is largely shaped by the 
flaw unique to those with absolute power.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.370
When you have never experienced 
a hard fought battle,

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.000
your tactics become monotonous.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.150
If you ask me,

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.420
the strong lack a sense of danger.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:31.570
Even now you seem to think that 
you aren't going to die.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.390
So what?!

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:36.370
Allow me to say it clearly.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:40.810
There is nothing in this world 
that cannot be destroyed.

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.360
Ard!

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.570
Thank goodness you're not hurt!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.350
Thank goodness!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:56.370
Wait.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:05.000
Ard Meteor!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.310
It's not over!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:08.760
It's not finished yet!

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.440
Good grief.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.680
No one likes an insistent woman.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.730
Begone!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.140
Miss Ireena.

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:28.390
I would prefer it if you please 
not watch the battle from here.

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:29.400
Ard?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.460
That past of old is pain.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.740
That is the life of a pathetic man.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.180
That one is alone.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.680
Even though there are those who follow him,

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.410
none rule together with him.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.620
No one understands him.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.160
Everyone leaves him.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.090
Even his one and only friend tossed him away.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.050
He sinks into a sea of madness and isolation.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:55.660
Despair, Ard Meteor!

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.130
There will be no relief in such an end.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.730
It will be death by drowning
 in anguish and despair.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.230
Surely that will be...

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.650
The Story of a Lonely King.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.280
Private Kingdom.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.110
Th-This is...

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.490
Threat designation: Level 3.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.070
Releasing limiters by 15%.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:19.040
Commencing defensive action.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.720
What is that?!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.510
Who on earth are you?!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.670
Shall we dance for the first 
time in a while, Lydia?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.220
Yes, my lord.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.570
I'm just a villager!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:53.240
But I'll fight you in your arena.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.000
Now keep up, scumbag!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.710
You're challenging a dragon 
to an aerial battle?!

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:58.980
Such arrogance!

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:00.910
I'll make you pay with your life!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.840
Magic reaction from below.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:09.880
High probability of circle 
formation in 0.2 seconds.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:16.840
Thermal reaction from left and right.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.220
Direct hit imminent in 3 
seconds at current speed.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.030
Construct the acceleration spell.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.910
We'll counterattack after dodging.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.140
Yes, my lord.

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:32.440
Lydia, ready Code Alpha!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.130
Affirmative.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.990
Stand by for Executioner Ray.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.950
Complete. Ready to fire.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.170
Too slow, too slow!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.340
Not enough!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.020
That was easy.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.710
You'll be way happier off dying here.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.860
Your Ireeny is a monster,

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:55.670
but you're on another level!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.600
You're both the same, and you'll 
never be able to stay friends.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:05.020
She will come to fear you and 
betray you without hesitation.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:12.480
There is no love or friendship in this world!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.130
Ard...

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.650
Now die in isolation!

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:23.200
That's a fitting end for you!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.420
Ard!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:28.580
You can do it!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:32.170
Don't you go losing to 
someone like her, you hear?!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.630
You've made one mistake.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.360
I'm not alone anymore.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.660
Lydia, ready Phase II!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.440
Roger.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.560
Shifting to Brave Demon 
Full Body, Second Form.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:58.860
Analysis complete.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.100
Activating Magic Canceller.

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:11.960
It's over, Ard Meteor!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.590
What on earth?!

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:23.250
Analyze, understand, and control.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:25.560
That's the essence of how I fight.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:28.320
I understand everything about you now.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.770
Not just the way you structure your magic.

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.230
Even your true, inner feelings.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.660
Huh?!

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:39.640
Ultimately, you just hated the fact 
that world forced you into solitude

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.400
all by yourself, didn't you?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:48.830
But I won't forgive you for dragging my 
friend into such retaliatory destruction.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:55.750
Frenzied Dragon King, perish in despair.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.920
This is the first time

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.180
I've ever felt so furious!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.830
Ready Code Sigma.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.400
Affirmative.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.590
Preparing Ultimatum Zero.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:13.870
Magical energy charge at 40 percent.

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.100
Fifty percent...

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.740
Elsym Rufasa Ulvis Azra!

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.240
Eighty percent...

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.030
Ninety percent...

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:27.200
Charge has reached 100 percent.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.490
What shall we do now?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.990
No other choice.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.960
Ultimatum Zero.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.280
Fire!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:50.570
Am I dying?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.030
Ard Meteor...

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:55.400
You killed...?

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:02.800
Lydia.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.820
Thank you for your help.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.470
Now return inside my soul.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.060
Yes, my lord.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.820
Miss Ireena.

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:27.760
M-Man, you really are incredible, Ard!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.060
So, Miss Ireena...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.730
Will you continue to be my friend?

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.880
Of course I will!

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:38.440
I look forward to it, Ard!

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.580
Thanks.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.380
Well, we should hurry back.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.400
Miss Ginny should be preparing us dinner.

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.880
<i>What am I even thinking?</i>

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:55.040
<i>Ard said he was my friend even 
after learning my secret.</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>I have to get stronger.</i>

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.700
<i>I have to become stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.050
<i>so I can stand beside Ard.</i>

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:06.770
<i>Then I'm sure he'll...</i>
